e your progression as you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear skins from the closet and customize your playground as desired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/9c391a35713a3fb91849021ee8f35619.poster.avif?t=1788711841\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/9c391a35713a3fb91849021ee8f35619.webm?t=1788711841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/9c391a35713a3fb91849021ee8f35619.mp4?t=1788711841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPLETE YOUR COLLECTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain levels throughout the game and discover new galaxies with their own categories of stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find super rare real stars and constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique constellations and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/e89535086197a2d8009f24e3932881d4.poster.avif?t=1788711841\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/e89535086197a2d8009f24e3932881d4.webm?t=1788711841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/e89535086197a2d8009f24e3932881d4.mp4?t=1788711841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920420/extras/72f4634e3ad3b0059968bfc736cb825e.avif?t=1788711841\" width=250 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong> <i>Game's background is not transparent/has black borders.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A: Restart the game, it should only happen on certain setups and at the first launch. If it doesn't work, you can try disabling &quot;fullscreen optimizations&quot; in the game's .exe properties.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong> <i>My game is out of my screen's boundaries/not visible.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A: Press CTRL + S + M to recenter the game on your primary monitor, it should unlock the situation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong> <i>I have questions, feedback or suggestions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> <strong>Join the Eleven Dusks Studios discord server (link on the right, under basic information) and send them to me!</strong></p>",
